	(text "Antenna evaluation kit, board an043_ref.\n\nAntenna: AN043 / SWRA117D, 2450 MHz, an exact copy of the note's\nown dimension table, checked by its verify_against_* script.\n\nGround plane: 40 x 28 mm, this repo's own choice - the note publishes no plane size.\n\nMatching: Z1=DNP  Z2=0R  Z3=DNP\nSWRA117D publishes no matching values and no ground plane size. The plane here is this repo's own 40 x 23.75 mm, not TI's - the note only says plane size affects performance.\n\n2.95 mm wide 50 ohm microstrip on 1.6 mm FR4 (er 4.5),\nthe same on all six boards so the launch is not a variable.\n\nBefore simulating or running DRC: fill the zones (B in the PCB\neditor). KiCad stores them unfilled and a plane is half the antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 112 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "794a8258-2bee-5682-a11a-7a63abf9b1de")
	)
